1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:02,430
(Amy:)between two pieces of acrylic.

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:04,420
(Penny:)Oh, it's a snowflake
from the North Pole.

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:05,920
(Penny:)Leonard gave it
to me last year.

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,590
(Bernadette:)Oh, God, that is so romantic.

5
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:10,690
(Penny:)Yeah, it was.

6
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:13,090
(Bernadette:)Leonard's really one of a kind.

7
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:15,030
(Amy:)Saying that
while holding a snowflake

8
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,100
is a bit heavy-handed,
don't you think?

9
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,450
(Penny:)Let me see that.

10
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,450
(Penny:)Oh, screw it.

11
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,970
(Penny:)I can deal with
a little self-loathing.

12
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:27,410
(Penny:)Let's go find me
a heinie to bite.

13
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,040
(Amy:)Outstanding.

14
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,380
(Amy:)And if we fail,
we can always stop at CVS

15
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:34,510
(Amy:)and pick you out
a nice toothbrush.

16
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:37,830
I call mine "Gerard."

17
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:42,920
(Bernadette:)That's kind of creepy.

18
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:47,590
♪ Don't go breaking
my heart ♪

19
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:49,460
♪ I couldn't
if I tried ♪

20
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:54,650
♪ Oh, honey,
if I get restless ♪

21
00:00:54,650 --> 00:01:00,020
♪ Baby, you're
not that kind ♪

